Modifications (September 2026): the plugin has been renamed and re-scoped for
UK pensions and retirement advisers. The US regulatory content (SEC, FINRA,
Reg BI) has been replaced with FCA and UK tax content. US-specific connectors
have been removed. The alts-brief and estate-and-tax-brief skills and the
titling-compare agent have been removed or replaced. The
retirement-income-review, pension-transfer-check,
death-benefits-and-tax-brief, fact-find-setup and fact-find skills, the
nomination-compare and fact-extract agents, and the fact-find scripts and
examples are new.
All remaining skills, agents and documentation have been edited for the UK.

